  "title": "Basic Fruit Bread Recipe",
  "description": "Do not confuse this with the dense Christmas bread with maraschino cherries. This fruit bread recipe is simply a blueprint for making quick bread with fruits or vegetables, from apple to rhubarb or carrot to zucchini.",
  "authors": [
